abstract: >-
  The implementation of the paper "Universe24: one simple rule, the formulas
  it shares with nature and adds" (Alon Gonen, 2026): a cubic lattice of Nodes,
  each holding two levels and a remainder per line of a field, stepped by one
  rule, Rule3, in the law's flux form, a Node's level changing by what crosses
  its six Links at each Link's reach, less the Node's own mass term, the
  remainder carried; whole numbers of any size, the bound the engine's; the tick
  the count of rounds that no Node reads; every run returning its past to the
  bit; and read only through the clicks of declared NodeDetectors. The engine
  holds no number of physics, no formula and no family's name; every physical
  value comes from the run's files, and every primitive is one folder found by
  its name. The paper's documents, files and scripts are in the repository.
